_zgOfe9NCb3ogIzkFyqdMxnLeOwXxtyzlb60U8EJCA65bzxpdxCAxAndNbcF_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHm_qfhafcKmiE_Rx92SMbzReXloOo7Md85Fmh2UmJqEw&oe=6A974A57"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pTXfsBY9L00Q7kNvwFXoUa6&_nc_oc=AdorAp0Mwfbmx8R1KJFlfP2yHGcSVZE2UBvyIufhrHcSxLO5bTO0N0xnxXTgLEcJH8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGrnrWVt5q-LUxlNNsDSjdUH71bn6R1GP843EaRja6CSw&oe=6A974861"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7ChIgdcDTIYQ7kNvwFTQtiG&_nc_oc=Adr2VUDx_OO6f7WxgCVbIsZdh794Gu5D4XPL33hOGb8NjEA4xkbGXj-_zWXpqxiCLvs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETlhcu3lk1DdeDCH1Yp4MB28Rqc2obR7q5nakJ9P-idQ&oe=6A973697"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aekcDTsa3gcQ7kNvwEn6qOS&_nc_oc=AdoRjWq8xVThIyT9xMff-yvYWXj2fdY-RMDGV20RncpM4t0iyqc7DoE1pSK8R7qAk7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGjc24FqdH7hDShoqURR40rCH4kpMGb9ce793TagS8JlA&oe=6A973D22"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lLGYh2CKzR0Q7kNvwGmFa9u&_nc_oc=AdpWPJ3eFrZjZKiayaNsiZeu0VUeqLLaIor8HZ_DIjSueUnkGdhRcKW72aU9tJcyjJY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG5RoeDGnpmKBeFpAPqObmefLCRQZWRwMVfg8tXQjhdFQ&oe=6A97296E"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null